  "longBusinessSummary": "GFT Technologies SE, together with its subsidiaries, provides digital transformation services. It operates in two segments in the Americas, the UK & APAC; and Continental Europe. The company offers Wynxx, a GenAI powered software delivery, Smaragd, a regulatory compliance suite, and Engenion, a project portfolio management. It also provides services including AI services, AI consulting, data services, cloud services, software engineering, infrastructure and application management, and platform modernization. GFT Technologies SE has a strategic partnership with INTEC Industrie-Technik GmbH to advance the modernization and sustainment of mission-critical systems for defense organizations through sovereign, operationally ready AI.The company serves clients in investment and retail banking, insurance, and industrial sectors. GFT Technologies SE was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Stuttgart, Germany.",
